        "text": "**Defining Messaging Models**\n\nI'm now focusing on creating `messaging_client.py` and `messaging_models.py`, taking inspiration from `publish_event.py`. I see a good starting point using `google.cloud.pubsub_v1`, configuring it with `project_id` and `topic_id`. I'm going to start developing these modules right now.\n\n\n**Developing Client and Models**\n\nI've decided to start with `messaging_client.py`, aiming for a general client for Pub/Sub. My plan is to make it capable of both publishing and consuming messages. The foundation will be `google.cloud.pubsub_v1`, configured with `project_id` and `topic_id`, just like `publish_event.py` did.\n\n\n",
