      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Event Consumption**\n\nI'm focusing on the `consume_event.py` script. My goal is to use it to consume a single message from a managed subscription. I'll be using `messaging_client.py` and `messaging_models.py` in this process, ensuring seamless integration and data handling.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789789678984,
          "start": 1789789678957
