      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining Dead Letter Logic**\n\nI'm currently focused on `dead_letter.py` and implementing a mechanism for handling failed messages. My initial plan involves sending these messages to a dead-letter destination, specifically a designated Google Cloud Pub/Sub topic in this case. I believe this offers a robust way to manage and analyze messages that couldn't be processed successfully.\n\n\n",
