    {
      "data": {
        "text": "**Demonstrating Batch Publishing**\n\nOkay, I'm working on `batch_publish.py` now. The core idea is to show how to explicitly publish a batch of messages, even though the Pub/Sub clients handle it automatically. This file is intended to provide a clear demonstration of that capability.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789789684113,
          "start": 1789789684078
        },
